# Deny everything, then re-include only what the build needs.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so an allowlist is the only safe shape here:
# a deny-list has to be kept in step with every new secret-bearing file, and
# missing one bakes live API keys into the build layer where `docker history`
# will show them. Anything not named below never enters the build context.
*
!src
!static
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
